{"nodes": [{"id": "remediation1_report", "label": "Remediation Report Primera Ronda", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-05-09", "author": "Alberto Mart\u00ednez + Claude Code", "contributor": null}, {"id": "remediation1_totp_secret_unique", "label": "Secret TOTP \u00danico por Usuario", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/setup-totp/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes: secret hardcodeado JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP compartido por todos. Despu\u00e9s: crypto.getRandomValues genera 20 bytes criptogr\u00e1ficamente seguros \u00fanicos por usuario. Eliminaba CVE que permit\u00eda a cualquiera generar c\u00f3digos v\u00e1lidos para cualquier cuenta."}, {"id": "remediation1_webhook_hmac", "label": "Verificaci\u00f3n HMAC Webhooks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/payment-webhook/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reescritura completa con HMAC-SHA256 para Stripe (con anti-replay por timestamp), MercadoPago (manifest format), PayPal (RSA via API REST) y Hey Banco (body raw). Sin verificaci\u00f3n cualquier HTTP request pod\u00eda triggear confirmaciones de pago."}, {"id": "remediation1_amount_validation", "label": "Validaci\u00f3n de Monto en Webhooks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/payment-webhook/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sin validaci\u00f3n un atacante pod\u00eda pagar $1 para un pedido de $10,000. Ahora se consulta total_amount de la orden y se compara con Math.round contra el monto recibido en el webhook."}, {"id": "remediation1_idor_payment_gateways", "label": "Correcci\u00f3n IDOR Gateways de Pago", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/manage-payment-gateways/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Antes cualquier vendor autenticado ve\u00eda configuraci\u00f3n de todos los vendors (sin filtro por vendor_id). Corregido filtrando .eq('vendor_id', vendorId) estrictamente por el vendor autenticado."}, {"id": "remediation1_stock_restore_cancel", "label": "Restauraci\u00f3n de Stock en Cancelaciones", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/migrations/00011_fix_order_cancellation.sql", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cancelar orden paid dejaba stock reducido permanentemente. Nueva funci\u00f3n PL/pgSQL restaura stock_quantity por cada order_item con fulfillment_status = reserved cuando se cancela desde estado paid o in_production."}, {"id": "remediation1_audit_tables", "label": "Tablas audit_logs y payment_transactions", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/migrations/00012_audit_payment_tables.sql", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "remediation1_rate_limiting_login", "label": "Rate Limiting en Login", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/login/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sin l\u00edmite de intentos permit\u00eda ataques de fuerza bruta ilimitados. Implementado con RPC check_rate_limit: 5 intentos / 300 segundos por identificador IP:email."}, {"id": "remediation1_password_complexity", "label": "Validaci\u00f3n de Complejidad de Contrase\u00f1a", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "supabase/functions/change-password/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sin validaci\u00f3n permit\u00eda contrase\u00f1as como 'a'. Ahora requiere m\u00ednimo 12 caracteres, may\u00fascula, min\u00fascula, n\u00famero y car\u00e1cter especial."}], "edges": [{"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_totp_secret_unique", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 1 - 1.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_webhook_hmac", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 2 - 2.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_amount_validation", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 2 - 2.3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_idor_payment_gateways", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 2 - 2.4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_stock_restore_cancel", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 2 - 2.6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_audit_tables", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/audit/REMEDIATION.md", "source_location": "Fase 3 - 3.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "remediation1_report", "target": "remediation1_rate_limiting_login", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "con